                        "arabic_name": "ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ",
                        "translated_name": "Who taught by the pen,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6111,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "5",
                        "arabic_name": "عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ",
                        "translated_name": "Taught man what he did not know."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6112,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "6",
                        "arabic_name": "كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "And yet, but yet man is rebellious,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6113,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "7",
                        "arabic_name": "أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "For he thinks he is sufficient in himself."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6114,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "8",
                        "arabic_name": "إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Surely your returning is to your Lord."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6115,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "9",
                        "arabic_name": "أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Have you seen him who restrains"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6116,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "10",
                        "arabic_name": "عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "A votary when he turns to his devotions?"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6117,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "11",
                        "arabic_name": "أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Have you thought, if he had been on guidance"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6118,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "12",
                        "arabic_name": "أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Or had enjoined piety, (it would have been better)?"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6119,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "13",
                        "arabic_name": "أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Have you thought that if he denies and turns away,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6120,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "14",
                        "arabic_name": "أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Does he not know that God sees?"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6121,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "15",
                        "arabic_name": "كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ",
                        "translated_name": "And yet indeed if he does not desist We shall drag him by the forelock,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6122,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "16",
                        "arabic_name": "نَاصِيَةٍ كَـٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍ",
                        "translated_name": "By the lying, the sinful forelock."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6123,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "17",
                        "arabic_name": "فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ",
                        "translated_name": "So let him call his associates,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6124,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "18",
                        "arabic_name": "سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ",
                        "translated_name": "We shall call the guards of Hell."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6125,
                        "chapter_id": 96,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "19",
                        "arabic_name": "كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩",
                        "translated_name": "Beware! Do not obey him, but bow in adoration and draw near (to your Lord)."
                    }
